This is a repeat of the information that I sent out a week and a half ago.

Don't forget to bring a flashlight so that you can walk around at night.

-Bill

Location
--------

The retreat is at the Pajaro Dunes conference center, on Monterey Bay,
near the town of Watsonville.  Directions are below.  The phone number
for Pajaro Dunes is (408) 722-9201, or (800)-675-8808.

The web page for Pajaro Dunes is at http://www.pajaro-dunes.com

Check in
--------
When you arrive, check in at the rental/real-estate office near the
entrance to Pajaro Dunes.  Give them your name and tell them you are
with the Stanford group.  They have a list of names and houses, and
they will give you a key to the appropriate house.

Schedule Summary
----------------

Scheduled events are from
6:00 PM on Monday August 16 to
1:00 PM on Wednesday August 18

The Monday dinner and most subsequent events will be in the
"Sandpiper" building at Pajaro Dunes.

The detailed schedule is below.

You are encouraged to come early on Monday and/or stay late on Wednesday
to enjoy the beach.  We will try to get a beach volleyball game going
on Monday afternoon.  Look for other IMTV'ers at the volleyball court.


Don't forget to bring:
---------------------

* A flashlight.  Pajaro Dunes recommends one for walking around at night.
* Any beach gear you want -- surfboard, suntan lotion, swimsuit, etc.

Misc
----
* The houses have phones.  Local calls are free, but you will have to use
  a calling card for other calls.
* Each house has several rooms (typically four).  Not all rooms have their
  own bathroom, so in some cases you will be sharing a bathroom.

Directions
----------
(If you want a map, one is available at http://www.pajaro-dunes.com)

* Take either highway 101 South or 280 South (whichever is more
  convenient) to Highway 85 South.
* Take Highway 85 South to Highway 17 South (Santa Cruz)
* Take Highway 17 South to Highway 1 South (Watsonville).
  The turn onto Highway 1 is just ouside of Santa Cruz.
* Take Highway 1 South to Riverside Drive / Highway #129
  This turn is at the south end of Watsonville.
  Turn right on Riverside Drive.
* Take Riverside Drive to dead end (Chevron Station)
* Turn right onto Lee Rd., go to first stop sign.
* Turn left onto Beach Road.
* Go to end of Beach Road.
* Turn left into Pajaro Dunes gate.

